<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
      <span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1364180890" about="#mwt7" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Message box/ambox.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><table class="box-Overly_detailed plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-style ambox-overly_detailed" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div class="mbox-image-div"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Edit-clear.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f2/Edit-clear.svg/40px-Edit-clear.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f2/Edit-clear.svg/120px-Edit-clear.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" data-file-type="drawing" height="40" width="40" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">This article <b>contains an excessive amount of intricate <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:DETAIL" title="Wikipedia:DETAIL" class="mw-redirect">detail</a></b>.<span class="hide-when-compact"> Please help <a rel="mw:ExtLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Second_presidency_of_Donald_Trump&amp;action=edit" class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Second_presidency_of_Donald_Trump&amp;action=edit">improve it</a> by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Content_forks#Article_spinoffs:_.22Summary_style.22_meta-articles_and_summary_sections" title="Wikipedia:Content forks">spinning off</a> or <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Handling_trivia#Recommendations_for_handling_trivia" title="Wikipedia:Handling trivia">relocating</a> relevant information and removing excessive detail that goes against <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:What_Wikipedia_is_not" title="Wikipedia:What Wikipedia is not">Wikipedia's inclusion policy</a>.</span>  <span class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">June 2025</span>)</i></span><span class="hide-when-compact"><i> (<small><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Maintenance_template_removal" title="Help:Maintenance template removal">Learn how and when to remove this message</a></small>)</i></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Wikipedia_articles_that_are_excessively_detailed_from_June_2025"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_articles_that_are_excessively_detailed"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Wikipedia_articles_with_style_issues_from_June_2025"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_articles_with_style_issues"/>
