<li about="#cite_note-59" id="cite_note-59" data-mw-footnote-number="58"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwFgw"><a href="#cite_ref-59" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwFg0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwFg4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-59" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt225" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwFg8" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite ","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" news "},"2":{"wt":"last=Peterson "},"3":{"wt":"first=Matt "},"4":{"wt":"date=January 21, 2025 "},"5":{"wt":"title=Trump&apos;s New Executive Orders Show His Power—and His Limits "},"6":{"wt":"work=Barron&apos;s "},"7":{"wt":"url=https://www.barrons.com/amp/articles/trump-executive-orders-limits-d3d67243 "},"8":{"wt":"url-access=subscription "},"9":{"wt":"access-date=January 23, 2025 "},"10":{"wt":"quote=President Donald Trump&apos;s first day back on the job began with what has been dubbed a shock and awe campaign, a burst of dozens of executive orders meant to jump-start his political and economic strategies. "},"11":{"wt":"archive-date=January 24, 2025 "},"12":{"wt":"archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250124115259/https://www.barrons.com/amp/articles/trump-executive-orders-limits-d3d67243 "},"13":{"wt":"url-status=live "}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="mwFhA" class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt225" data-x-id="CITEREFPeterson2025">Peterson, Matt (January 21, 2025). <span class="id-lock-subscription" title="Paid subscription required" id="mwFhE"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.barrons.com/amp/articles/trump-executive-orders-limits-d3d67243" class="external text" id="mwFhI">"Trump's New Executive Orders Show His Power—and His Limits"</a></span>. <i id="mwFhM">Barron's</i>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20250124115259/https://www.barrons.com/amp/articles/trump-executive-orders-limits-d3d67243" class="external text" id="mwFhQ">Archived</a> from the original on January 24, 2025<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwFhU">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwFhY">January 23,</span> 2025</span>. <q id="mwFhc">President Donald Trump's first day back on the job began with what has been dubbed a shock and awe campaign, a burst of dozens of executive orders meant to jump-start his political and economic strategies.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Barron%27s&amp;rft.atitle=Trump%27s+New+Executive+Orders+Show+His+Power%E2%80%94and+His+Limits&amp;rft.date=2025-01-21&amp;rft.aulast=Peterson&amp;rft.aufirst=Matt&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.barrons.com%2Famp%2Farticles%2Ftrump-executive-orders-limits-d3d67243&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt225" id="mwFhg"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-60" id="cite_note-60" data-mw-footnote-number="59"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwFhk"><a href="#cite_ref-60" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwFho"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwFhs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-60" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt228" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwFhw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite magazine ","href":"./Template:Cite_magazine"},"params":{"last":{"wt":"Popli"},"first":{"wt":"Nik"},"date":{"wt":"January 24, 2025"},"title":{"wt":"Trump&apos;s Early Actions Mirror Project 2025"},"url":{"wt":"https://time.com/7209901/donald-trump-executive-actions-project-2025/"},"access-date":{"wt":"January 25, 2025"},"magazine":{"wt":"Time"},"language":{"wt":"en"},"archive-date":{"wt":"January 25, 2025"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250125064527/https://time.com/7209901/donald-trump-executive-actions-project-2025/"},"url-status":{"wt":"dead"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFPopli2025" class="citation magazine cs1" about="#mwt228">Popli, Nik (January 24, 2025). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20250125064527/https://time.com/7209901/donald-trump-executive-actions-project-2025/" class="external text" id="mwFh0">"Trump's Early Actions Mirror Project 2025"</a>. <i id="mwFh4">Time</i>. Archived from <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://time.com/7209901/donald-trump-executive-actions-project-2025/" class="external text" id="mwFh8">the original</a> on January 25, 2025<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwFiA">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwFiE">January 25,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Time&amp;rft.atitle=Trump%27s+Early+Actions+Mirror+Project+2025&amp;rft.date=2025-01-24&amp;rft.aulast=Popli&amp;rft.aufirst=Nik&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Ftime.com%2F7209901%2Fdonald-trump-executive-actions-project-2025%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt228" id="mwFiI"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-61" id="cite_note-61" data-mw-footnote-number="60"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwFiM"><a href="#cite_ref-61" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwFiQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwFiU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-61" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt231" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwFiY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite ","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" news "},"2":{"wt":"last1=Tamari "},"3":{"wt":"first1=Jonathan "},"4":{"wt":"last2=Lee "},"5":{"wt":"first2=Brandon "},"6":{"wt":"date=January 24, 2025 "},"7":{"wt":"title=Trump&apos;s Early Actions Mirror Project 2025 Plan He Once Dismissed "},"8":{"wt":"work=[[Bloomberg Government]] "},"9":{"wt":"url=https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-01-24/trump-s-early-actions-mirror-project-2025-plan-he-once-dismissed "},"10":{"wt":"url-access=subscription "},"11":{"wt":"access-date=January 24, 2025 "},"12":{"wt":"quote=In all, more than 30 out of Trump&apos;s 47 initial executive actions as of Thursday afternoon match or partially align with ideas promoted in Project 2025, the analysis found. "},"13":{"wt":"archive-date=May 8, 2025 "},"14":{"wt":"archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250508004343/https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-01-24/trump-s-early-actions-mirror-project-2025-plan-he-once-dismissed "},"15":{"wt":"url-status=live "}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFTamariLee2025" class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt231">Tamari, Jonathan; Lee, Brandon (January 24, 2025). <span class="id-lock-subscription" title="Paid subscription required" id="mwFic"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-01-24/trump-s-early-actions-mirror-project-2025-plan-he-once-d