<li about="#cite_note-217" id="cite_note-217" data-mw-footnote-number="216"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwHKE"><a href="#cite_ref-217" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwHKI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwHKM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-217" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt772" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwHKQ" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"news"},"2":{"wt":"accessdate=October 13, 2025 "},"3":{"wt":"date=October 10, 2025 "},"4":{"wt":"newspaper=Washington Post "},"5":{"wt":"title=RFK Jr. linked circumcision and Tylenol to autism. Here&apos;s what scientists say "},"6":{"wt":"url=https://www.washingtonpost.com/health/2025/10/10/circumcision-tylenol-autism-rfk/"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt772" id="mwHKU"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.washingtonpost.com/health/2025/10/10/circumcision-tylenol-autism-rfk/" class="external text" id="mwHKY">"RFK Jr. linked circumcision and Tylenol to autism. Here's what scientists say"</a>. <i id="mwHKc">Washington Post</i>. October 10, 2025<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwHKg">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwHKk">October 13,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Washington+Post&amp;rft.atitle=RFK+Jr.+linked+circumcision+and+Tylenol+to+autism.+Here%27s+what+scientists+say&amp;rft.date=2025-10-10&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.washingtonpost.com%2Fhealth%2F2025%2F10%2F10%2Fcircumcision-tylenol-autism-rfk%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt772" id="mwHKo"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-CBS,_deals_on_prescription_pricing,_Dec_19,_2025-218" id="cite_note-CBS,_deals_on_prescription_pricing,_Dec_19,_2025-218" data-mw-footnote-number="217"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwHKs"><a href="#cite_ref-CBS,_deals_on_prescription_pricing,_Dec_19,_2025_218-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwHKw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwHK0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-CBS,_deals_on_prescription_pricing,_Dec_19,_2025-218" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-announces-agreements-with-9-more-drugmakers-to-lower-prices-for-medicaid-recipients/" class="external text" id="mwHK4">"Trump announces agreements with 9 major drugmakers to lower prices"</a> <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20251228105920/https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-announces-agreements-with-9-more-drugmakers-to-lower-prices-for-medicaid-recipients/" about="#mwt775" typeof="mw:Transclusion" class="external text" id="mwHK8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Webarchive","href":"./Template:Webarchive"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228105920/https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-announces-agreements-with-9-more-drugmakers-to-lower-prices-for-medicaid-recipients/"},"date":{"wt":"December 28, 2025"}},"i":0}}]}'>Archived</a><span about="#mwt775" id="mwHLA"> December 28, 2025, at the </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wayback_Machine" title="Wayback Machine" about="#mwt775" id="mwHLE">Wayback Machine</a><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Webarchive_template_wayback_links" about="#mwt775" id="mwHLI"/>, CBS News, December 19, 2025. The nine new deals are with Amgen, Boehringer Ingelheim, Bristol Myers Squibb, Genentech, Gilead Science, GSK, Merck, Novartis, and Sanofi. The Trump administration had previously announced deals with AstraZeneca, EMD Serono, Eli Lilly, Novo Nordisk and Pfizer.</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-CNN,_deals_w/_pharmacy_companies,_Dec_19,_2025-219" id="cite_note-CNN,_deals_w/_pharmacy_companies,_Dec_19,_2025-219" data-mw-footnote-number="218"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwHLM"><a href="#cite_ref-CNN,_deals_w/_pharmacy_companies,_Dec_19,_2025_219-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwHLQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwHLU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-CNN,_deals_w/_pharmacy_companies,_Dec_19,_2025-219" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt777" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwHLY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite ","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" news "},"2":{"wt":"url=https://www.cnn.com/2025/12/19/politics/us-drug-prices-trump-nation-deals "},"3":{"wt":"title=Trump announces &apos;Most Favored Nation&apos; deals with nine drug companies and plans to meet with insurers next "},"4":{"wt":"work=CNN "},"5":{"wt":"date=December 19, 2025 "},"6":{"wt":"quote=Merck, for instance, said it will reduce the price of its Januvia diabetes drug on TrumpRx to $100, from $330. Gilead will provide its Hepatitis C medication, Epclusa, for $2,425, rather than $24,920. GSK will make its asthma inhaler Advair Diskus 500/50 available for $89, from $265. "},"7":{"wt":"archive-date=December 23, 2025 "},"8":{"wt":"access-date=December 24, 2025 "},"9":{"wt":"archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251223210745/https://www.cnn.com/2025/12/19/politics/us-drug-prices-trump-nation-deals "},"10":{"wt":"url-status=live "}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt777" id="mwHLc"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.cnn.com/2025/12/19/politics/us-drug-prices-trump-nation-deals" class="external text" id="mwHLg">"Trump announces 'Most Favored Nation' deals with nine drug companies and plans to meet with insurers next"</a>. <i id="mwHLk">CNN</i>. December 19, 2025. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20251223210745/https://www.cnn.com/2025/12/19/politics/us-drug-prices-trump-nation-deals" class="external text" id="mwHLo">Archived</a> from the original on December 23, 2025<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwHLs">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwHLw">December 24,</span> 2025</span>. <q id="mwHL0">Merck, for instance, said it will reduce the price of its Januvia diabetes drug on TrumpRx to $100, from $330. Gilead will provide its Hepatitis C medication, Epclusa, for $2,425, rather than $24,920. GSK will make its asthma inhaler Advair Diskus 500/50 available for $89, from $265.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=CNN&amp;rft.atitle=Trump+announces+%27Most+Favored+Nation%27+deals+with+nine+drug+companies+and+plans+to+meet+with+insurers+next&amp;rft.date=2025-12-19&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnn.com%2F2025%2F12%2F19%2Fpolitics%2Fus-drug-prices-trump-nation-deals&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt777" id="mwHL4"></span></span></li>
