<li about="#cite_note-334" id="cite_note-334" data-mw-footnote-number="333"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwIZQ"><a href="#cite_ref-334" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwIZU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwIZY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-334" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1170" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwIZc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite ","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" news "},"2":{"wt":"last= "},"3":{"wt":"first= "},"4":{"wt":"title=Maduro&apos;s replacement launches &apos;purge-lite&apos; to consolidate her power "},"5":{"wt":"url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/world-news/2026/05/02/maduro-successor-purge-traitors-power-venezuela/ "},"6":{"wt":"newspaper=The Telegraph "},"7":{"wt":"date=2 May 2026 "},"8":{"wt":"access-date=20 July 2026"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt1170" id="mwIZg"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.telegraph.co.uk/world-news/2026/05/02/maduro-successor-purge-traitors-power-venezuela/" class="external text" id="mwIZk">"Maduro's replacement launches 'purge-lite' to consolidate her power"</a>. <i id="mwIZo">The Telegraph</i>. May 2, 2026<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwIZs">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwIZw">July 20,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Telegraph&amp;rft.atitle=Maduro%27s+replacement+launches+%27purge-lite%27+to+consolidate+her+power&amp;rft.date=2026-05-02&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.telegraph.co.uk%2Fworld-news%2F2026%2F05%2F02%2Fmaduro-successor-purge-traitors-power-venezuela%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1170" id="mwIZ0"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-NYT_07112026-335" id="cite_note-NYT_07112026-335" data-mw-footnote-number="334"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwIZ4"><a href="#cite_ref-NYT_07112026_335-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwIZ8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwIaA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-NYT_07112026-335" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1173" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwIaE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite ","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" news "},"2":{"wt":"last=Pager "},"3":{"wt":"first=Tyler "},"4":{"wt":"last2=Kurmanaev "},"5":{"wt":"first2=Anatoly "},"6":{"wt":"date=July 11, 2026 "},"7":{"wt":"title=How Marco Rubio Is Running Venezuela From Afar "},"8":{"wt":"url=https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/11/us/politics/how-marco-rubio-runs-venezuela.html "},"9":{"wt":"access-date=July 12, 2026 "},"10":{"wt":"work=The New York Times "},"11":{"wt":"language=en-US "},"12":{"wt":"issn=0362-4331"},"13":{"wt":"quote=The secretary of state effectively controls Venezuela&apos;s finances, the distribution of its natural resources and its government. His grip on the country is a vivid manifestation of American power in the Trump era."}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFPagerKurmanaev2026" class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt1173">Pager, Tyler; Kurmanaev, Anatoly (July 11, 2026). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/11/us/politics/how-marco-rubio-runs-venezuela.html" class="external text" id="mwIaI">"How Marco Rubio Is Running Venezuela From Afar"</a>. <i id="mwIaM">The New York Times</i>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)" title="ISSN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwIaQ">ISSN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwIaU"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0362-4331" class="external text" id="mwIaY">0362-4331</a><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwIac">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwIag">July 12,</span> 2026</span>. <q id="mwIak">The secretary of state effectively controls Venezuela's finances, the distribution of its natural resources and its government. His grip on the country is a vivid manifestation of American power in the Trump era.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+York+Times&amp;rft.atitle=How+Marco+Rubio+Is+Running+Venezuela+From+Afar&amp;rft.date=2026-07-11&amp;rft.issn=0362-4331&amp;rft.aulast=Pager&amp;rft.aufirst=Tyler&amp;rft.au=Kurmanaev%2C+Anatoly&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F2026%2F07%2F11%2Fus%2Fpolitics%2Fhow-marco-rubio-runs-venezuela.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1173" id="mwIao"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-Callaghan_01042026-336" id="cite_note-Callaghan_01042026-336" data-mw-footnote-number="335"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwIas"><a href="#cite_ref-Callaghan_01042026_336-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwIaw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwIa0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-Callaghan_01042026-336" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1176" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwIa4" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"news"},"2":{"wt":"last=Callaghan"},"3":{"wt":"first=Louise"},"4":{"wt":"date=January 4, 2026"},"5":{"wt":"title=Who leads Venezuela now? Trump has picked his grudging puppet"},"6":{"wt":"work=[[The Times]]"},"7":{"wt":"url=https://www.thetimes.com/world/latin-america/article/delcy-rodriguez-venezuela-leader-maria-corina-machado-5b292xg3r"},"8":{"wt":"url-access=subscription"},"9":{"wt":"access-date=July 12, 2026"},"10":{"wt":"quote=After a life spent working to advance socialism and fighting US imperialism, Rodríguez, a former lawyer and diplomat, now appears to be being strong-armed by Trump into leading her country as an American puppet state, with the threat of full-scale military invasion if she does not co-operate."}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFCallaghan2026" class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt1176">Callaghan, Louise (January 4, 2026). <span class="id-lock-subscription" title="Paid subscription required" id="mwIa8"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.thetimes.com/world/latin-america/article/delcy-rodriguez-venezuela-leader-maria-corina-machado-5b292xg3r" class="external text" id="mwIbA">"Who leads Venezuela now? Trump has picked his grudging puppet"</a></span>. <i id="mwIbE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Times" title="The Times" id="mwIbI">The Times</a></i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwIbM">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwIbQ">July 12,</span> 2026</span>. <q id="mwIbU">After a life spent working to advance socialism and fighting US imperialism, Rodríguez, a former lawyer and diplomat, now appears to be being strong-armed by Trump into leading her country as an American puppet state, with the threat of full-scale military invasion if she does not co-operate.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Times&amp;rft.atitle=Who+leads+Venezuela+now%3F+Trump+has+picked+his+grudging+puppet&amp;rft.date=2026-01-04&amp;rft.aulast=Callaghan&amp;rft.aufirst=Louise&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thetimes.com%2Fworld%2Flatin-america%2Farticle%2Fdelcy-rodriguez-venezuela-leader-maria-corina-machado-5b292xg3r&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1176" id="mwIbY"></span></span></li>
