e=AP+News&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+launches+deadly+wave+of+airstrikes+across+Gaza+after+ceasefire+talks+stall&amp;rft.date=2025-03-18&amp;rft.aulast=Shurafa&amp;rft.aufirst=Wafaa&amp;rft.au=Mednick%2C+Sam&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Fisrael-palestinians-hamas-war-news-ceasefire-hostages-03-17-2025-b8753b9458a44f10ab08aa9b12582780&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1572" id="mwJlY"></span></li>
