,</span> 2025</span>. <q id="mwJmA">Hours later, Hamas fired three rockets at Israel without causing casualties, in the first such attack since Israel broke the ceasefire on Tuesday.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=AP+News&amp;rft.atitle=Strikes+in+Gaza+kill+85+overnight%2C+bringing+the+total+since+Israel+broke+ceasefire+to+nearly+600&amp;rft.date=2025-03-20&amp;rft.aulast=Shurafa&amp;rft.aufirst=Wafaa&amp;rft.au=Magdy%2C+Samy&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Fisrael-palestinians-hamas-war-news-ceasefire-hostages-03-20-2025-36c07d3dc7c03f66f86f44409d504d43&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1574" id="mwJmE"></span></li>
<li id="mwJmI"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1576" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwJmM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite ","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" news "},"2":{"wt":"last1=Martínez "},"3":{"wt":"first1=A "},"4":{"wt":"last2=Lonsdorf "},"5":{"wt":"first2=Kat "},"6":{"wt":"date=March 20, 2025 "},"7":{"wt":"title=Israel launches new ground invasion into Gaza after breaking ceasefire "},"8":{"wt":"url=https://www.npr.org/2025/03/20/nx-s1-5333858/israel-launches-new-ground-invasion-into-gaza-after-breaking-ceasefire "},"9":{"wt":"access-date=April 1, 2025 "},"10":{"wt":"work=[[NPR]] "},"11":{"wt":"quote=Israel has launched a new ground offensive in Gaza after it broke the nearly two-month-long ceasefire with Hamas."}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFMartínezLonsdorf2025" class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt1576">Martínez, A; Lonsdorf, Kat (March 20, 2025). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.npr.org/2025/03/20/nx-s1-5333858/israel-launches-new-ground-invasion-into-gaza-after-breaking-ceasefire" class="external text" id="mwJmQ">"Israel launches new ground invasion into Gaza after breaking ceasefire"</a>. <i id="mwJmU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NPR" title="NPR" id="mwJmY">NPR</a></i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwJmc">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwJmg">April 1,</span> 2025</span>. <q id="mwJmk">Israel has launched a new ground offensive in Gaza after it broke the nearly two-month-long ceasefire with Hamas.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=NPR&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+launches+new+ground+invasion+into+Gaza+after+breaking+ceasefire&amp;rft.date=2025-03-20&amp;rft.aulast=Mart%C3%ADnez&amp;rft.