<li about="#cite_note-dab-581" id="cite_note-dab-581" data-mw-footnote-number="579"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwKtk"><a href="#cite_ref-dab_581-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwKto"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKts">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-dab-581" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1977" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwKtw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite ","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" news "},"2":{"wt":"title=Eksperter: USA fører hybridkrig mod Grønland"},"3":{"wt":"trans-title=Experts: The USA is waging hybrid warfare against Greenland"},"4":{"wt":"url=https://borsen.dk/nyheder/politik/eksperter-er-ikke-i-tvivl-usa-forer-hybridkrig-i-gronland "},"5":{"wt":"access-date=January 9, 2026 "},"6":{"wt":"work=[[Dagbladet Børsen]] "},"7":{"wt":"quote=Det er decideret hybrid krigsførelse, når amerikanerne forsøger at købe sig til et valgresultat i Grønland, vurderer to eksperter. Det lyder ganske problematisk: en allieret, der fører aktiv hybridkrig mod en anden allieret. Det er ikke desto mindre den virkelighed, Danmark og Grønland befinder sig i, når USA tager en bred vifte af metoder i brug for at lægge pres på Rigsfællesskabet."},"8":{"wt":"trans-quote=It clearly amounts to hybrid warfare when the Americans try to buy their way to an election result in Greenland, two experts assess. It sounds quite problematic: an ally conducting active hybrid warfare against another ally. Nevertheless, this is the reality that Denmark and Greenland find themselves in when the United States employs a broad range of methods to exert pressure on the Realm.\n"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt1977" id="mwKt0"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://borsen.dk/nyheder/politik/eksperter-er-ikke-i-tvivl-usa-forer-hybridkrig-i-gronland" class="external text" id="mwKt4">"Eksperter: USA fører hybridkrig mod Grønland"</a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKt8">[</span>Experts: The USA is waging hybrid warfare against Greenland<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKuA">]</span>. <i id="mwKuE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dagbladet_Børsen" title="Dagbladet Børsen" id="mwKuI">Dagbladet Børsen</a></i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwKuM">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwKuQ">January 9,</span> 2026</span>. <q id="mwKuU">Det er decideret hybrid krigsførelse, når amerikanerne forsøger at købe sig til et valgresultat i Grønland, vurderer to eksperter. Det lyder ganske problematisk: en allieret, der fører aktiv hybridkrig mod en anden allieret. Det er ikke desto mindre den virkelighed, Danmark og Grønland befinder sig i, når USA tager en bred vifte af metoder i brug for at lægge pres på Rigsfællesskabet.</q> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKuY">[</span>It clearly amounts to hybrid warfare when the Americans try to buy their way to an election result in Greenland, two experts assess. It sounds quite problematic: an ally conducting active hybrid warfare against another ally. Nevertheless, this is the reality that Denmark and Greenland find themselves in when the United States employs a broad range of methods to exert pressure on the Realm.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKuc">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Dagbladet+B%C3%B8rsen&amp;rft.atitle=Eksperter%3A+USA+f%C3%B8rer+hybridkrig+mod+Gr%C3%B8nland&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fborsen.dk%2Fnyheder%2Fpolitik%2Feksperter-er-ikke-i-tvivl-usa-forer-hybridkrig-i-gronland&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1977" id="mwKug"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-mefr-582" id="cite_note-mefr-582" data-mw-footnote-number="580"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwKuk"><a href="#cite_ref-mefr_582-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwKuo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKus">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-mefr-582" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1980" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwKuw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite ","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" news "},"2":{"wt":"title=Denmark&apos;s prime minister says Trump is serious about Greenland&apos;s annexation "},"3":{"wt":"url=https://www.europeaninterest.eu/denmarks-prime-minister-says-trump-is-serious-about-greenlands-annexation/ "},"4":{"wt":"access-date=January 6, 2026 "},"5":{"wt":"work=European Interest"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt1980" id="mwKu0"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.europeaninterest.eu/denmarks-prime-minister-says-trump-is-serious-about-greenlands-annexation/" class="external text" id="mwKu4">"Denmark's prime minister says Trump is serious about Greenland's annexation"</a>. <i id="mwKu8">European Interest</i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwKvA">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwKvE">January 6,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=European+Interest&amp;rft.atitle=Denmark%27s+prime+minister+says+Trump+is+serious+about+Greenland%27s+annexation&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.europeaninterest.eu%2Fdenmarks-prime-minister-says-trump-is-serious-about-greenlands-annexation%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1980" id="mwKvI"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-politico-583" id="cite_note-politico-583" data-mw-footnote-number="581"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwKvM"><a href="#cite_ref-politico_583-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwKvQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKvU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-politico-583" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1983" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwKvY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#invoke:cite ","function":"invoke"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" news "},"2":{"wt":"title=Danish intelligence classifies Trump&apos;s America as a security risk "},"3":{"wt":"url=https://www.politico.eu/article/danish-intelligence-classifies-donald-trump-america-as-security-risk/ "},"4":{"wt":"access-date=January 6, 2026 "},"5":{"wt":"work=Politico"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt1983" id="mwKvc"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.politico.eu/article/danish-intelligence-classifies-donald-trump-america-as-security-risk/" class="external text" id="mwKvg">"Danish intelligence classifies Trump's America as a security risk"</a>. <i id="mwKvk">Politico</i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwKvo">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwKvs">January 6,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Politico&amp;rft.atitle=Danish+intelligence+classifies+Trump%27s+America+as+a+security+risk&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.politico.eu%2Farticle%2Fdanish-intelligence-classifies-donald-trump-america-as-security-risk%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1983" id="mwKvw"></span></span></li>
