;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+York+Times&amp;rft.atitle=As+Trump+Broadens+Crackdown%2C+Focus+Expands+to+Legal+Immigrants+and+Tourists&amp;rft.date=2025-03-21&amp;rft.issn=0362-4331&amp;rft.aulast=Kanno-Youngs&amp;rft.aufirst=Zolan&amp;rft.au=Pager%2C+Tyler&amp;rft.au=Aleaziz%2C+Hamed&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F2025%2F03%2F21%2Fus%2Fpolitics%2Ftrump-immigration-visa-crackdown.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" id="mwMMM"></span></span></li>
