te><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=AP+News&amp;rft.atitle=Trump%27s+moves+test+the+limits+of+presidential+power+and+the+resilience+of+US+democracy&amp;rft.date=2025-03-01&amp;rft.aulast=Riccardi&amp;rft.aufirst=Nicholas&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Ftrump-democracy-autocrats-authoritarian-constitution-threat-542ac437a58880e81c052f8f2df1643f&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASecond+presidency+of+Donald+Trump" class="Z3988" id="mwMNk"></span></span></li>
